{"id":"wb-7-1836","name":"湘南起义旧址群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"湘南起义旧址群","text":"湘南起义旧址群是中华人民共和国湖南省的湘南地区与湘南起义相关的一系列建筑。自2011年以来，中华人民共和国国务院、湖南省人民政府先后将部分郴州市、衡阳市和株洲市境内与湘南起义有关的建筑定为全国重点文物保护单位或湖南省文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B9%98%E5%8D%97%E8%B5%B7%E4%B9%89%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":94385617,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94385617","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2e2f6264b02ad8b71d95c86c.jpg","title":"汝城会议旧址文保碑_20250710_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B1%9D%E5%9F%8E%E4%BC%9A%E8%AE%AE%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80%E6%96%87%E4%BF%9D%E7%A2%91_20250710_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/20/%E6%B1%9D%E5%9F%8E%E4%BC%9A%E8%AE%AE%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80%E6%96%87%E4%BF%9D%E7%A2%91_20250710_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"FradonStar","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0","caption":"​汝城会议旧址（朱家大院），全国重点文物保护单位湘南起义旧址群的子项","width":320,"height":240}}